    - target: {fileID: 1981340692621462641, guid: ce8041ed761b7354e981ddd60380bc55, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "The dense jungles of Ashar Prime are rumored to hide an ancient alien
        artifact of immense power. Your mission is to locate this relic, but be warned:
        many have tried and none have returned. The local wildlife is hostile, and
        strange energy readings suggest you won\u2019t be the only one seeking the
        artifact. Recover it before it falls into the wrong hands."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
